msgstr "Visa öppettider i RRD-grafer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use "
"either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd "
"service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on "
"using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr ""
"Hur ofta Cactis datainsamlare ska startas. Du kan använda crontab, en "
"schemalagd aktivitet i Windows eller systemd-tjänsten cactid för att starta "
"insamlaren. Instruktioner för cactid finns i filen README.md i "
"tjänstekatalogen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Uppdatera insamlarens tabell varje cykel"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Loggning av ogiltiga data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options "
"include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the "
"number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error"
" counts."
msgstr ""
"Hur ska datainsamlarens utdatafel loggas? ”Detaljerad” beskriver varje fel, "
"”Sammanfattning” anger antalet utdatafel per enhet och ”Ingen” utelämnar "
"felantal."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Varje månad på söndag"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s minut"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s timme"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one "
"concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr ""
"Antalet samtidiga processer för insammarkommandon. Högst ett kommando per "
"värd körs samtidigt i poolen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here "
"are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr ""
"Inställningarna hanteras för respektive datainsamlare. Värdena här används "
"endast som standard när en datainsamlare skapas."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  "
"NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data "
"Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data "
"Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve "
"performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the "
"threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and "
"leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the "
"number of CPU cores."
msgstr ""
"Standardantalet samtidiga processer per datainsamlare. OBS! Från och med "
"Cacti 1.2 hanteras inställningen i datainsamlaren och värdet här är endast "
"en förinställning. Ett högre antal kan förbättra prestandan med cmd.php. För"
" Spine förbättras prestandan i stället främst med trådparametern; använd "
"därför färre processer och fler trådar. Med cmd.php bör antalet processer "
"inte överstiga dubbla antalet CPU-kärnor."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Särskilda användare"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically "
"receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these "
"Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative "
"account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr ""
"Namnet på det primära administratörskontot som automatiskt får e-post när "
"Cacti-systemet har problem. Kontrollera att e-postinställningarna är "
"korrekta och att kontot har en e-postadress."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr ""
"Namnet på gästanvändaren som kan visa grafer. Standardvärdet är ”Ingen "
"användare”."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated"
" to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the "
"basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr ""
"Om grundläggande autentisering används och kontot behöver kopplas till ett "
"annat inloggningskonto kan du ange en CSV-fil som mappar kontona."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "Fältet från LDAP som ska användas som e-postadress. (I Windows: mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"In cases where the Cacti server is experiencing problems, should the Primary"
" Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Cacti user"
" account is specified under the Authentication tab on Cacti's settings page."
" It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr ""
"Ska den primära administratören meddelas via e-post när Cacti-servern har "
"problem? Administratörens användarkonto anges under fliken Autentisering på "
"Cactis inställningssida. Standardkontot är ”admin”."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the E-Mail message including all attachments."
msgstr "Maximal storlek på e-postmeddelandet inklusive alla bilagor."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Cacti uses a PHP based DNS "
"resolver."
msgstr ""
"Ange DNS-tidsgränsen i millisekunder. Cacti använder en PHP-baserad DNS-"
"resolver."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the"
" RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr ""
"Antalet samtidiga Boost-processer som ska bearbeta alla RRD-poster i Boost-"
"tabellen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"If this field is non-blank, Boost will log RRDUpdate output from the "
"boost\tpoller process."
msgstr ""
"Om fältet inte är tomt loggar Boost RRDUpdate-utdata från Boost-"
"insamlarprocessen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Image Caching"
msgstr "Aktivera bildcachning"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Ska datakällstatistik samlas in för detta Cacti-system?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in "
"mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr ""
"Antalet på varandra följande timmar som timmedelvärdet omfattar. Ett för "
"högt värde kan ge mycket stora minnestabeller."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Data Source Statistics Data Collector"
msgstr "Minnesgräns för insamlaren av datakällstatistik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the "
"RRDfiles will be one of the "
"following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You"
" can make this change after install by running the CLI script "
"<b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you "
"change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if "
"you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after"
" you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr ""
"Använd en separat undermapp för varje värds RRD-filer. Filernas sökvägar "
"följer något av dessa "
"mönster:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Du"
" kan göra ändringen efter installationen genom att köra kommandoradsskriptet"
" <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> efter att inställningen ändrats. OBS! Om du "
"minskar det maximala antalet kataloger eller ändrar katalogmönstret tas "
"tomma kataloger inte bort när skriptet <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> körs "
"igen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy "
"is running in MSR mode."
msgstr ""
"DNS-värdnamnet eller IP-adressen till RRDtools reservproxyserver om proxyn "
"körs i MSR-läge."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "TCP-port för krypterad kommunikation med reservproxyn."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove "
"any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of "
"samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% "
"more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a "
"certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the "
"spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr ""
"Det finns två metoder för borttagning. Standardavvikelse tar bort mätvärden "
"som ligger ett angivet antal standardavvikelser från medelvärdet. Varians "
"tar bort mätvärden som överstiger variansmedelvärdet med en angiven "
"procentandel. Variansmetoden tar hänsyn till avvikande värden, exempelvis "
"toppar, som ska uteslutas ur beräkningen av medelvärdet."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be "
"excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be "
"operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr ""
"Värden som ligger så här många standardavvikelser över medelvärdet utesluts."
" Ett lämpligt antal beror på typen av data. Vi rekommenderar minst fem "
"standardavvikelser."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"Do you wish to periodically remove spikes from your graphs?  If so, select "
"the frequency below."
msgstr ""
"Vill du ta bort toppar från graferna regelbundet? Välj i så fall frekvensen "
"nedan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"How would you like Cacti to present dates?  This setting will also change "
"the way that Cacti Graphs dates are represented."
msgstr ""
"Hur ska Cacti visa datum? Inställningen påverkar även datum i Cactis grafer."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Defines the preferred GUI language."
msgstr "Anger föredraget språk för användargränssnittet."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"The number of columns to use when displaying Thumbnail graphs in Preview "
"mode."
msgstr "Antalet kolumner för grafminiatyrer i förhandsvisningen."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid ""
"For users with Console access only, how long this user can stay logged in "
"before being automatically logged out.  Note that if you have not been "
"active in more than an hour, you may have to refresh your browser.  Also "
"note that this setting has no affect when Authentication Cookies are "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Hur länge användare med konsolåtkomst kan vara inloggade innan de loggas ut "
"automatiskt. Om du har varit inaktiv i mer än en timme kan du behöva "
"uppdatera webbläsaren. Inställningen har ingen effekt när "
"autentiseringskakor är aktiverade."

